publish.longDesc=\n"Experience\ a\ modern\ take\ on\ the\ classic\ Snake\ game\ with\ this\ Greenfoot\ project.\ The\ game\ features\ a\ dynamic\ scoring\ system\ where\ the\ snake\ grows\ in\ size\ each\ time\ it\ eats\ food.\ The\ player\ navigates\ the\ snake\ using\ arrow\ keys,\ aiming\ to\ consume\ food\ scattered\ across\ the\ screen\ while\ avoiding\ the\ edges\ to\ prevent\ the\ game\ from\ ending.\ With\ a\ custom\ background,\ responsive\ controls,\ and\ an\ increasing\ challenge\ as\ the\ snake\ grows,\ this\ game\ offers\ both\ fun\ and\ a\ nostalgic\ experience.\ Ideal\ for\ demonstrating\ Greenfoot\ programming\ skills\ with\ simple\ yet\ engaging\ gameplay\ mechanics."\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
publish.shortDesc=An\ interactive\ Snake\ game\ built\ in\ Greenfoot,\ featuring\ a\ dynamic\ scoring\ system\ and\ growing\ snake\ mechanics
